OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC closures make business sense, but
OL,4,Afar more savings are needed, says Katie
OL,5,ARazzall
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Scotland's TV channel was watched,
OL,8,Faccording to this year's annual report,
OL,9,Fby a weekly average of 12% of the
OL,10,FScottish population. Scots simply
OL,11,Faren't tuning in in the numbers to make
OL,12,Fit cost-effective.
OL,14,F(Fascinatingly, BBC Alba, which is
OL,15,Faimed at Gaelic speakers and learners,
OL,16,Freached 43% of Scots weekly - was it
OL,17,Fboosted by its rights to broadcast
OL,18,FItalian football's Serie A, with the
OL,19,Fcommentary mainly in Gaelic?)
